As long as I can make the express back to cover the rally, I'm happy.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:06.480
I am not going to miss out on a front page story just because he thinks I can't take care of myself.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:13.519
So your town is quaint. How many people live out here?

00:08:13.519 --> 00:08:15.519
Our whole congregation.

00:08:15.519 --> 00:08:17.519
We're believers.

00:08:17.519 --> 00:08:22.519
Father bought this land long before I was born, and we've just walked here from Idaho, so we could all live together.

