All our tests indicate that his condition is irreversible.

00:11:14.129 --> 00:11:18.129
If the accelerated mitosis persists, his body will eventually give out.

00:11:18.129 --> 00:11:19.129
I'm very sorry.

00:11:19.129 --> 00:11:22.129
He's aged four years and two weeks, so sorry isn't good enough.

00:11:22.129 --> 00:11:28.080
isn't good enough.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.080
He needs to be at the facility where we can study him around the clock.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.080
Alexander stays here with me.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:41.600
I want him to believe that he is like any other normal child.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.600
But we both know he's not normal.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.600
And no matter how many parties you throw him, he never will be.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:52.700
I just want to protect.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:57.929
I want to give him a second chance.

00:11:57.929 --> 00:12:02.200
Dr. Lamelle, I know that you had a hand

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:06.200
in the horrors that Lex Luthorter committed in his labs over the years.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:13.690
And I chose you to run this team because I know deep down in your heart,

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.690
in your heart.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:20.279
You want to make things right.

00:12:20.279 --> 00:12:21.279
More than anything.

00:12:21.279 --> 00:12:29.039
You find me a cure to save Alexander,

00:12:29.039 --> 00:12:31.039
and I promise you,

00:12:31.039 --> 00:12:33.039
I will not let him become that monster.

00:12:33.039 --> 00:12:46.559
Do something, help him!

00:12:46.559 --> 00:13:14.309
Mois!

00:13:14.309 --> 00:13:17.309
Mr. I think we're barking up the wrong tree.

00:13:17.309 --> 00:13:20.309
There's nothing out here for miles.

00:13:20.309 --> 00:13:22.309
Look, these tracks are probably left by hundreds.

00:13:22.309 --> 00:13:25.309
They bring in carts back in here to haul out game all the time.

00:13:25.309 --> 00:13:28.309
Do they also leave spikes in the road to give people flat tires?

00:13:28.309 --> 00:13:30.309
Two by four probably fell out.

00:13:30.309 --> 00:13:32.309
off a passing truck.

