Look, it's only natural for you to be worried about your girlfriend.

00:13:37.139 --> 00:13:38.139
She's the most important thing in my life.

00:13:38.139 --> 00:13:40.139
Well, you said she was upset with you.

00:13:40.139 --> 00:13:42.139
I bet she hitched a ride.

00:13:42.139 --> 00:13:45.139
You go back to Metropolis and I guarantee she'll be waiting.

00:13:45.139 --> 00:13:52.350
The crystals in this water?

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.350
Ah. Meteor Shower 89. A couple of meteors hit the spring.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.350
Blue Meteor rock?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.350
Yeah. Killed one local and destroyed acres of crops.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.350
But it did give us a gift.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:09.340
It has drinking water in the county.

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:11.340
Meteor seems to purify it.

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:12.340
And everyone here is okay.

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.340
Because I grew up in Smallville.

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:17.340
The Green Meteor Rock has been harming people

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:19.340
for the last 20 years.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:21.340
Not here. I've drinking this water my whole life.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.340
I haven't had so much as a calm and cold.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.340
Yep, we're all just fine.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:30.029
There's nothing out here than what was that?

00:14:30.029 --> 00:14:47.299
Something I wish you hadn't heard.

00:14:47.299 --> 00:14:49.299
I'm sorry I ruined the party.

00:14:49.299 --> 00:14:51.299
It's not your fault.

00:14:51.299 --> 00:14:53.299
I know that something is wrong with me.

00:14:53.299 --> 00:14:54.299
I'm free.

00:14:54.299 --> 00:14:57.299
No. No, you're not. You're a beautiful little boy.

00:14:57.299 --> 00:14:59.299
And I promise you that I am going.

00:14:59.299 --> 00:15:06.710
going to make everything okay.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:10.019
You have to tell me something.

00:15:10.019 --> 00:15:14.429
Right before you blacked out, you were drawing this.

00:15:14.429 --> 00:15:16.429
How do you know this symbol?

00:15:16.429 --> 00:15:18.429
It's just a drawing.

00:15:18.429 --> 00:15:24.889
Alexander, I found these.

00:15:24.889 --> 00:15:33.740
Hidden in your closet.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.740
Please tell me what they mean to you.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.740
It's the symbol of the bad man.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:42.740
He comes into my dreams to hurt me.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:46.759
I'd never let anyone hurt you.

00:15:46.759 --> 00:15:47.759
You can't stop him.

00:15:47.759 --> 00:15:48.759
I can't stop him.

00:15:48.759 --> 00:15:49.759
You're safe here.

00:15:49.759 --> 00:15:50.759
No!

00:15:50.759 --> 00:15:53.759
He's the strongest man in the whole world.

00:15:53.759 --> 00:15:55.759
You can't protect me.

00:15:55.759 --> 00:15:57.759
I'd never let anything happen to you.

00:15:57.759 --> 00:16:12.879
You want to kill me!

00:16:12.879 --> 00:16:15.879
I know this is hard for you to believe when you're so frightened,

00:16:15.879 --> 00:16:16.879
but...

00:16:16.879 --> 00:16:27.690
Alexander, I'm here for you.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:28.690
Alexander?

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:35.029
Alexander.

00:16:35.029 --> 00:16:49.860
Yeah.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:54.860
And to think you fix this all without a kitchen aid or Costco?

00:16:54.860 --> 00:17:02.460
You believe in a simple love.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:07.460
No modern technology and no worldly temptation.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.460
We keep to ourselves.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:13.460
Helps us stay on the righteous path.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:18.460
Speaking of paths, isn't it time we hit the road?

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:22.460
Our teachings say when people come together to eat,

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:25.460
you make time for your fellow man.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.460
Oh, trust me.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:29.460
You don't forget Sunday school on the military base.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.460
You should finish your dinner.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.660
It would be best.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.160
I had luck for a guest to leave our table earlier

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.160
on the night of the harvest celebration.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.160
Yeah.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.160
As long as we hit the road as soon as we're finished.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:50.680
I would love to stay and see the festivities one day.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.920
I bet that's a lot of fun.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.920
Fun has nothing to do with it.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:18:03.680
We glorify the day we were shown the Lord's sign.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.680
What exactly was a sign?

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:15.799
From the heavens.

00:18:15.799 --> 00:18:17.799
Tear down our village.

00:18:17.799 --> 00:18:20.799
And our daughter Esther was taken from us.

00:18:20.799 --> 00:18:32.250
from us. She was ringing the town bell to warn everyone of the danger.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:36.690
She was struck down where she stood.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:43.269
Oh, I am so sorry.

00:18:43.269 --> 00:18:46.269
Before that, we suffered terrible drought.

00:18:46.269 --> 00:18:49.269
In years of bad crops.

00:18:49.269 --> 00:18:54.119
People were hungry, sick.

00:18:54.119 --> 00:18:57.119
But our daughter gave her life so that we could all prosper.

00:18:57.119 --> 00:19:02.119
Ever since, our crops have been bountiful

00:19:02.119 --> 00:19:03.119
and our people never.

00:19:03.119 --> 00:19:05.119
Our people never get sick.

00:19:05.119 --> 00:19:06.119
Amen.

00:19:06.119 --> 00:19:13.400
I think this happened because your daughter died.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:22.519
I'm pretty sure that didn't make it into the good book I read.

00:19:22.519 --> 00:19:28.369
I don't expect you to understand.

00:19:28.369 --> 00:19:31.369
You're not a believer.

00:19:31.369 --> 00:19:37.369
But every year since her death, we have offered our Lord a sacrifice.

00:19:37.369 --> 00:19:53.319
If you're done, I'll clear your plate.

00:19:53.319 --> 00:19:56.319
Oh, yeah. Stuffed.

00:19:56.319 --> 00:19:58.319
Thank you.

00:19:58.319 --> 00:20:00.319
It's lovely.

00:20:00.319 --> 00:20:10.819
I'm a little squeamish when it comes to the slaughtering of the fatted calf.

00:20:10.819 --> 00:20:14.819
So just tell your parents, thank you. Okay? I'm gonna go.

00:20:14.819 --> 00:20:17.819
We'll never let you leave.

00:20:17.819 --> 00:20:19.819
What?

00:20:19.819 --> 00:20:21.819
You've been chosen.

00:20:21.819 --> 00:20:23.819
Just like my sister.

00:20:23.819 --> 00:20:28.119
This was your last supper.

